To 'check divisibility' with a number called dividend and a number called divisor.
  Return a boolean,
    dividend modulo divisor is 0.
    
Print each number from 1 to 15,
    but if 'check divisibility' of the number and 15 is true print "FizzBuzz",
    but if 'check divisibility' of the number and 3 is true print "Fizz",
    but if 'check divisibility' of the number and 5 is true print "Buzz".
